  * NEW: Report generation with --save-report and --mail options
  * NEW: Interactive TUI menu integration for fail2ban health-fix
  * ENHANCEMENT: Bash completion for all fail2ban commands
  * ENHANCEMENT: Comprehensive service/log file checks before jail enable
  * DOCS: Complete man page section for fail2ban integration
  * FIX: Report location standardized to /var/log/nftban/reports/
  * FIX: SSH session compatibility for report output capture
  * FEATURE: Only disables crashing jails, never auto-enables

